⟩\n        exact ⟨u, ou, by simpa only [Set.inter_comm, eq_comm] using useq⟩\n  rw [continuousOn_iff_continuous_restrict, continuous_def]; simp only [this]","start":125,"end":134},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}